  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "கண்கயல் என்னும் கருத்தினால் காதலி\nபின்சென்றது அம்ம சிறுசிரல் - பின்சென்றும்\nஊக்கி யெழுந்தும் எறிகல்லா ஒண்புருவம்\nகோட்டிய வில்வாக் கறிந்து.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The lover in a figure praises the lustre of his beloved's eye, and the beauty of her arched brow; and indicates also his own timid reverence ‘The little kingfisher seeing the eyes of my beloved (as she was disporting in the tank) and taking them for carp, followed her; but though it followed, and poised itself aloft, it darted not down, recognising her gleaming brow bent above them as a bow!",
